WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.150
- Do you think that, I know
it's hard when you have kids

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.570
and there's a divorce, do you
think that your son actually

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:07.403
helped you a bit though?

00:00:07.403 --> 00:00:09.210
'Cause at least having that
little light in your life,

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.470
like do you know what I'm saying?

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.300
When it's so dark and it's
so do you think your son

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.320
kinda helped you get through--

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.550
- Well, parenting is a
very, you can, it's a,

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.950
you have to be selfless.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:18.783
- Ah I know.

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:20.683
- So it helped me in a sense.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:22.423
- Exhausting.

00:00:22.423 --> 00:00:23.359
- Right, aren't they so demanding?

00:00:23.359 --> 00:00:24.372
- And they still aren't thankful.

00:00:24.372 --> 00:00:26.020
- I know.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.020
But what helps about that
is that you're just not

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.320
always so self focused, you know.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.220
- You're ego's in check, yeah.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.780
- No, you're like no,
I'm a mom and I'm gonna,

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.290
I'm gonna do my best,
I'm committed to this

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.573
and that is a very healthy,

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.750
I don't wanna say distraction
but, preoccupation

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.100
that you love and enjoy
and it does bring pleasure

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.440
in your life in that sense of course.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.420
So it just wasn't always
about me all the time

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.580
and that was very very
helpful and you have to live

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:56.870
to tell the story, you
know I don't even remember

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.540
who this quote was from, but
you know you've gotta live it

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.880
to survive to tell the story

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.309
so the hunter doesn't get the glory.

00:01:02.309 --> 00:01:03.142
- Wow.

00:01:03.142 --> 00:01:06.410
- And whatever it is that
I, has pounced on you

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:11.410
or is challenging you
or weighing you down,

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:12.690
you can't let it win.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:16.120
You have to survive and
then it's so important

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.880
to tell the story, to share the story.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.730
So you've gotta survive to tell the story

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:24.550
and I just believe that that's
a great motto when you're--

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:25.974
- I love that, I want it like on a shirt--

00:01:25.974 --> 00:01:26.950
- Really like you want
to give up, you know.

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:28.840
